<p>According to <a href="https://timsong-cpp.github.io/cppwp/n4659/basic.stc.thread#2" rel="nofollow noreferrer">basic.stc.thread</a>, the variable t is constructed, shall be destroyed on thread exit. so I think that thread is not exit even the function <code>thread_1</code> returns.</p>
