<p>The .htaccess file has this in it</p>
<pre><code>&lt;IfModule mod_expires.c&gt;
ExpiresByType application/javascript &quot;access plus 2 days&quot;
  ExpiresByType image/jpg &quot;access plus 1 month&quot;
