Title: Golang: create TCP 3-way handshake using ipv4.NewRawConn.
Body: <p>I'm trying to successfully establish a TCP 3-way handshake.<br />
I want to be able to control the IP layer, ideally with <a href="https://github.com/google/gopacket" rel="noreferrer">github.com/google/gopacket</a>.</p>
