Body: <p>I don't know if I'm missing something, because my <code>Kotlin</code> code isn't finding the <code>Golang</code> socket server. I did a <code>netstat -ano</code> and the port 8000 was being used for TCP already so I think the socket server is running fine. But my android still can't find it. Both the server and the emulator is on the same network. Here's my code:</p>
<p>//server(Golang)</p>
