}
</code></pre>
<p>Now I'm wondering, why does that barebones code work and the one provided by googollee library doesn't? I don't think I missed any settings for both sides.</p>
<p>UPDATE:</p>
<p>Got some progress. Found an <code>android</code> code that works, but for some reason is doing some unexpected issue. Here's the details of the change I made on the android side:</p>
