<p>Thanks in advance.</p>
<p>Ender</p>
<p>EDIT: i changed my contentview xaml for using ControlTemplate. Added Resources and a contentPresenter at the point where i want to show the children added. But still can not see the children</p>
<pre><code>&lt;ContentView xmlns=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui&quot;
