Title: Reference Windows only project from NET MAUI.
Body: <p>I have been working on tool that is done using NET MAUI. Now I would like to automate Windows UI, but I can't figure out how to do that. I have tried to download FlaUI NuGet, but can't get it working as it requires project to be <code>Net7.0-windows</code>. So I have created new project with reference to Net7.0-windows, but then my references in Net Maui get corrupted.</p>
<p><strong>MauiApp1.csproj</strong> (project):</p>
<pre><code>&lt;Project Sdk=&quot;Microsoft.NET.Sdk&quot;&gt;

    &lt;PropertyGroup&gt;
        &lt;TargetFrameworks&gt;net7.0-android;net7.0-ios;net7.0-maccatalyst&lt;/TargetFrameworks&gt;
